      "seed": 616762898,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 1044896722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "3Qnv59ZyMjUyVQWe0WY1p",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "AerVZOZ22n3XLOXH_Hf4I",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791303474529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔗 Tightly Coupled vs Loosely Coupled\nTightly Coupled\nTwo components depend heavily on each other.\n\nService A ────────→ Service B\n   ↑                    ↑\nStrong dependency\n\nIf B changes or fails, A may also be affected.\n👉 Simple: They are strongly connected.\n\nLoosely Coupled\nTwo components have minimal dependency on each other.\n\nService A → API / Message → Service B\n\nB can change internally without heavily affecting A.\n👉 Simple: They work more independently.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔗 Tightly Coupled vs Loosely Coupled\nTightly Coupled\nTwo components depend heavily on each other.\n\nService A ────────→ Service B\n   ↑                    ↑\nStrong dependency\n\nIf B changes or fails, A may also be affected.\n👉 Simple: They are strongly connected.\n\nLoosely Coupled\nTwo components have minimal dependency on each other.\n\nService A → API / Message → Service B\n\nB can change internally without heavily affecting A.\n👉 Simple: They work more independently.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
